Event "1" *-- "*" WaitlistEntry : waitlist
EventService ..> EventBus : publishes registered /\nwaitlist promoted /\ncancelled (to waitlisted)

note right of EventFactory
  Simple Factory: one static create()
  is the only place that news a concrete
  Event. New kind = one subclass + one case.
end note

note bottom of Event
  Cancelled events refuse edits, reminders
  and check-in (requireNotCancelled).
  cancel() notifies observers, then tells
  each waitlisted attendee directly.
end note

note bottom of BasicTicket
  price is copied from the event's
  base price when the ticket is issued,
  so later price changes don't affect it.
end note

note right of Attendee
  Model class: stores notes only, never prints.
  A view prints takeNewNotes().
end note

note right of EventController
  MVC: EventView (View), EventController (Controller),
  EventService (Model). Opened from the main menu
  (embedded: 0 = Back); after each action the view shows
  the deliveries (passed in, so no import of Communication)
  and every attendee's new inbox notes.
end note
